  "disposition": "Original run directories are left untouched (immutable per AGENTS.md); this file records the invalidation post hoc. structure_gap cells computed under contiguous_block_by_logarithm are reported as raw numbers in structure_gap_cells.json but are marked invalid_measurement in execution-report.md and MUST NOT be read as evidence toward or against H-REPL-6c431d. Only the random_by_logarithm cells (27 of the 54 attempted matched cells) are valid measurements from this pilot. This also means the spec's requirement to run and report BOTH split modes was technically executed, but one of the two modes produced an invalid instrument, not a valid negative or positive result -- itself an observation to report, not paper over."
